<title>USA: Whittman-Hart to buy Chicago facility.</title>
<headline>Whittman-Hart to buy Chicago facility.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whittman-Hart Inc said Monday it signed a letter of intent to acquire a 35,000 square foot facility in Chicago's near West Loop in early April from the developer of Fulton Centre, a commercial and marketing complex.</p>
<p>It plans to expand that to more than 100,000 square feet by 2000.  The first phase is scheduled to be fully operational in the third quarter.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
